            "content": {
                "math_content": "\\begin{array}{r l} & {y _ {x h} (t) = B _ {1} + B _ {2} e ^ {- x t} + B _ {3} e ^ {- s t}} \\\\ & {5 f ^ {\\prime} (t) + 5 f (t) = 5 [ - 3 e ^ {- t} u (t) + \\sqrt [ 3 ]{t} ] + 1 5 e ^ {- t} u (t) = 1 5 \\sqrt [ 3 ]{(t)}} \\\\ & {t > 0 \\mathrm{时自由项} = 0 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{元} y _ {x p} (t)} \\\\ & {y _ {x} (t) = B _ {1} + B _ {2} e ^ {- x t} + B _ {3} e ^ {- s t}} \\\\ & {\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} {y _ {x s} ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) = a \\delta (t) + b \\Delta u (t)} & {\\Rightarrow a = 1 5} \\\\ {y _ {x s} ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) = a \\Delta u (t)} & {\\Rightarrow y _ {y s} ^ {\\prime \\prime} (0 +)} \\\\ {y _ {x s} ^ {\\prime} (t) = a t \\Delta u (t)} & {\\Rightarrow y _ {v s} ^ {\\prime} (0 +)} \\end{array} \\right. = y _ {v s} ^ {\\prime} (0 -) = v} \\end{array}",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
